<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 3.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 3.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 03	Jan 02	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  245.520     245.390     247.020    0.05 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  306.000     306.830     306.830   -0.27 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.390     158.700     158.970   -0.20 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.916	47.078	47.182   -0.34 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  416.100     418.180     419.180   -0.50 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.120     141.425     141.685   -0.22 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.109	16.144	16.185   -0.22 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  211.900     211.770     212.430    0.06 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.881	 1.883	 1.888   -0.11 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.575	 1.579	 1.581   -0.25 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.830     182.170     183.135   -0.19 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
